 ('A cache under load', 'var cache = map[string]int{}\nfunc update(k string) { cache[k]++ }', 'Concurrent request handlers race on the cache and may crash.', 'Preserve exact counts while synchronizing all accesses.', 'Go maps are not safe for concurrent writes; the read-modify-write needs one synchronization boundary.'),
