 ('A dark selector disagrees with the app', '@import "tailwindcss";\n/* app toggles data-theme="dark" on html */\n/* template uses dark:bg-black */', 'The manual theme toggle does not control dark styling as intended.', 'Align the configured dark variant with the application’s actual selector.', 'A data attribute does not automatically change the default dark-variant strategy; configure the intended variant.'),
