 ('A map lookup becomes empty CSS', '@use "sass:map";\n$colors: (primary: blue);\n.button { color: map.get($colors, "accent"); }', 'The intended color declaration disappears from compiled output.', 'Check the token key and define a missing-token policy.', 'The missing map key returns null, which can remove a declaration.'),
 ('An extend affects an unrelated component', '.message { border: 1px solid; }\n.sidebar .message { color: red; }\n.card { @extend .message; }', 'The card unexpectedly participates in selectors meant for messages.', 'Choose intentional shared declarations rather than accidental selector coupling.', 'extend unifies matching selectors across the stylesheet; it is not simple property copying.'),
