 ('A custom reset erases accessibility', '@layer base {\n *:focus { outline: none !important; box-shadow: none !important; }\n}', 'All keyboard focus indicators vanish, including those from copied components.', 'Remove the destructive reset and test visible focus for each state.', 'Global important reset declarations defeat component focus styles.'),
