 ('A token cycle survives an adapter migration', ':root { --primary: var(--color-primary); --color-primary: var(--primary); }\n.button { background: var(--primary); }', 'A primary background utility resolves invalidly after migration.', 'Separate primitive values, semantic tokens, and utility aliases without cycles.', 'The semantic token and its alias refer back to each other; the computed-value dependency graph is cyclic.'),
